{"c":[{"id":"961801789374c2175c3449024d4fab62e04ebf2e22a4f4651bd527456bad1a3d","sum":"Skip a root wake only when a == SumMem Usage == block is still readable. A consumer upgrade is copying the script; init prints the bootstrap and writes nothing; replace an old fat AGENTS.md prefix once.","tree":{"c":[{"name":"20260825T003337Z-7415cd62d790d57b","text":"Skip a root wake when a == SumMem Usage == block is still readable; do not skip on a remembered wake or the footer alone.","type":"note"},{"name":"20260825T003343Z-32520d7e11eb7ac8","text":"A consumer upgrade is copying the script; replace an old fat AGENTS.md prefix once. init prints the bootstrap and writes nothing.","type":"note"}]},"type":"nap"},{"id":"d0629b8c4f7d147aaabb8e74c1becbbbe8f9af17d5d6ebf5ec3656bde51f28fe","sum":"Onboarding is init (prompt_text()); root-wake catalog tests slice the catalog section.","tree":{"c":[{"name":"20260825T004057Z-33f2fad52281ba51","text":"Root-wake tests that pin catalog shape must slice the catalog section; Usage contains .summem/summem and wake --path.","type":"note"},{"name":"20260825T133725Z-1b75d9fa0073870a","text":"Onboarding is summem init (prompt_text()); there is no docs/agents-prompt.md copy.","type":"note"}]},"type":"nap"}]}
